<title>UK: Australian/N.Z. wool prices for February.</title>
<headline>Australian/N.Z. wool prices for February.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commonwealth Secretariat estimated Australian and New Zealand wool prices for February as follows, in pence per kilo clean, cif UK dry-combed.</p>
<p>   70s 445	  64s 353	  60s 293	  58s 277</p>
<p>   56s 259	  50s 233	  48s 215	  46s 199</p>
<p>Prices are based on quotations from sales in Australia and New Zealand and represent unweighted average for super, good and average fleeces and skirting (free and light burry). Quotes for 56s and coarser are confined to New Zealand wools.</p>
</text>
